{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55555","headline":"问诸学流偈 · 师静","name":"问诸学流偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若道法皆如幻有，造诸过恶应无咎。\n云何所作业不忘，而藉佛慈兴接诱。\n（《景德传灯录》卷二十一、《五灯会元》卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"师静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}